# GitHub after updates

After finishing code changes in this project, commit and push without waiting for a separate user request.

- Remote: `https://github.com/procosttt/pysprint.git`
- Author and committer for every commit: `procosttt <kostyapro1101@gmail.com>`
- Do not change `git config`
- Set identity only for the commit command, for example `git -c user.name="procosttt" -c user.email="kostyapro1101@gmail.com"` plus `GIT_AUTHOR_*` / `GIT_COMMITTER_*`
- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor author/committer
- Do not use `--no-verify` unless the user asks
- Do not force-push to `main`
- Push the current branch to `origin` after a successful commit
